From fc31330fcbc9583bab0cd31dac58dd5e42a9e28e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:43:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD backend slash-command routing so selected-agent
 commands bypass prompt sends

Selected-agent messages with slash command tokens use the provider command hook instead of ordinary prompt sends, so backend actions such as Codex status and fork commands do not consume first-message title turns or run through orchestrator reply processing.
